From be22b6a811036aa02731379d4abeda2a720422a0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@example.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 21:02:34 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix class creation: new classes no longer vanish (Class not
 found), draft classes need no teacher, add Class dialog to the + menu

- browser-save: reads return the newest in-flight save. Before, adding a class and opening its record page in the same moment made the page re-read the OLDER saved copy and wipe the class, which showed 'Class not found'
- school-store.test: reproduces that exact case with a timed IndexedDB stand-in (fails on the old code, passes now)
- class-records: a teacher is required only when a class is published, so a new draft class can be saved
- class-create: shared helper to build a new draft class (next free ID, terms, optional teacher)
- AdminTools: + menu has a working Class dialog (course, year, terms, optional teacher)
- admin.courses.index: fix two TS4111 type errors so tsc is clean
- tests for all of the above
